‎## 6. Principle Candidate — Rule #13
‎
‎**Proposed Rule #13: Command as Invariant**
‎
‎> **Rule #13:** Tools evolve. Ecosystems evolve. Inhabitants evolve. But the sequence Intent → Command → Execution → Feedback → Adaptation → Advance persists. The capacity to issue a meaningful command is the invariant. Protect it.
‎
